{"id":"c5b7418489e74141","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-comprehension-functor.md","title":"Comprehension functor","display":"df-comprehension-functor — Comprehension functor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-comprehension-functor","aliases":["16-df-comprehension-functor","Comprehension functor"],"display":"df-comprehension-functor — Comprehension functor","depends_on":["[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","[[16-df-functor]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-comprehension-functor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-comprehension-functor</span><span>Comprehension functor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-comprehension-functor — Comprehension functor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\)</span> (理解范畴, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\">\\(\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi(X)=\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX\">\\(\\chi(X)=\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}_1\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a> 已构造的定义域函子的箭头映射。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\">\\(X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal E\">\\(f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompFunctor}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompFunctor}\\)</span> 为本文件定义的理解函子谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{\\mathrm{top}}(f)\">\\(\\chi_{\\mathrm{top}}(f)\\)</span> 的定义在下节给出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{\\mathrm{top}}(f)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}_1(\\chi f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_{\\mathrm{top}}(f)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}_1(\\chi f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}comprehension\\text{-}functor} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompFunctor}(\\chi,p)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}comprehension\\text{-}functor} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompFunctor}(\\chi,p)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}comprehension\\text{-}functor} \\vdash \\operatorname{cod}(\\chi X)=pX\\land\\operatorname{cod}\\circ\\chi=p\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}comprehension\\text{-}functor} \\vdash \\operatorname{cod}(\\chi X)=pX\\land\\operatorname{cod}\\circ\\chi=p\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}comprehension\\text{-}functor} \\vdash (\\forall f:X\\to Y)\\;\\chi(f)=\\langle\\pi_X,\\pi_Y,\\chi_{\\mathrm{top}}(f),p(f)\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}comprehension\\text{-}functor} \\vdash (\\forall f:X\\to Y)\\;\\chi(f)=\\langle\\pi_X,\\pi_Y,\\chi_{\\mathrm{top}}(f),p(f)\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"chi(f)\">\\(chi(f)\\)</span> 是箭头范畴中的交换方块；本定义不无条件假设额外的右伴随。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)$ (理解范畴, see [[16-df-comprehension-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\chi(X)=\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX$；$\\operatorname{dom}_1$ 为 [[16-df-comprehension-category]] 已构造的定义域函子的箭头映射。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi(X)=\\pi_X:\\{X\\}\\to pX","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}_1","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompFunctor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_{\\mathrm{top}}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_{\\mathrm{top}}(f)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}_1(\\chi f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}comprehension\\text{-}functor} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompFunctor}(\\chi,p)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}comprehension\\text{-}functor} \\vdash \\operatorname{cod}(\\chi X)=pX\\land\\operatorname{cod}\\circ\\chi=p","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}comprehension\\text{-}functor} \\vdash (\\forall f:X\\to Y)\\;\\chi(f)=\\langle\\pi_X,\\pi_Y,\\chi_{\\mathrm{top}}(f),p(f)\\rangle","display":true},{"tex":"chi(f)","display":false}],"bytes":1478,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-functor|df-comprehension-functor — Comprehension functor]]"}],"outgoing":["0ba8f021ca287877","fc49efccd7348d66"]}